{
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "description": "告警面(Alertmanager + 运维到人的邮件桥)。原面板引用的 alertmanager_alerts_total / _by_severity / _mttr / _storm_detection / _top_rules 五个名字在本机一条序列都没有(Alertmanager 从不导出它们),2026-10-17 整盘改指真在采的 alertmanager_alerts{state} / alerts_received_total{status} / dispatcher_* 与自研 ihui_alertbridge_*。",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "返回 AI 总览",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/d/ihui-ai-overview",
      "targetBlank": false,
      "includeVars": true,
      "keepTime": true,
      "icon": "external link",
      "tags": ["ihui-ai"]
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "title": "24h 告警总数",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(increase(alertmanager_alerts_received_total{instance=~\"$instance\"}[$__range]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "接收告警数"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green"
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 100
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 500
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"]
        }
      },
      "id": 1
    },
    {
      "title": "告警状态分布",
      "type": "piechart",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (state) (alertmanager_alerts{instance=~\"$instance\"})",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{state}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "id": 2,
      "description": "Alertmanager 只按 state(active/suppressed/unprocessed)计数;severity 是规则侧标签,不在该指标上,故不再谎称\"分级\"。"
    },
    {
      "title": "告警平均处理耗时 (ms)",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "1000 * sum(rate(alertmanager_dispatcher_alert_processing_duration_seconds_sum{instance=~\"$instance\"}[5m])) / sum(rate(alertmanager_dispatcher_alert_processing_duration_seconds_count{instance=~\"$instance\"}[5m]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "平均处理耗时"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green"
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 15
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 60
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"]
        }
      },
      "id": 3,
      "description": "MTTR 需要\"告警恢复时刻\"这一事实源,Alertmanager 不导出;此处给可得的 dispatcher 处理耗时。无告警时分母为 0 ⇒ No data,是诚实结果。"
    },
    {
      "title": "聚合组数量",
      "type": "gauge",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "max(alertmanager_dispatcher_aggregation_groups{instance=~\"$instance\"})",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "聚合组"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green"
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 20
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 50
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"]
        }
      },
      "id": 4,
      "description": "\"风暴检测\"无对应导出器指标;改看真实存在的聚合组数量,持续增高即告警风暴的可用信号。"
    },
    {
      "title": "告警投递台账(窗口内增量)",
      "type": "table",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(increase(alertmanager_alerts_received_total{instance=~\"$instance\", status=\"firing\"}[$__range]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "收到(触发)"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(increase(alertmanager_alerts_received_total{instance=~\"$instance\", status=\"resolved\"}[$__range]))",
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "收到(恢复)"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(increase(ihui_alertbridge_alerts_dedup_suppressed_total{instance=~\"$instance\"}[$__range]))",
          "refId": "C",
          "legendFormat": "去重抑制"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(increase(ihui_alertbridge_mail_alerts_delivered_total{instance=~\"$instance\"}[$__range]))",
          "refId": "D",
          "legendFormat": "投递到人"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(increase(ihui_alertbridge_mail_batches_failed_total{instance=~\"$instance\"}[$__range]))",
          "refId": "E",
          "legendFormat": "投递失败"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "id": 5,
      "description": "从\"收到\"到\"到人\"整条链各自的窗口增量。原来的写法 {__name__=~\"多指标\"} 在本机实测 HTTP 422(vector cannot contain metrics with the same labelset)——多指标并扫在标签集相同处必炸,故改逐条具名 target。"
    },
    {
      "title": "告警接收速率 (按状态)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 14
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (status) (rate(alertmanager_alerts_received_total{instance=~\"$instance\"}[5m]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{status}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "id": 6
    },
    {
      "title": "邮件桥投递速率",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 14
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(ihui_alertbridge_alerts_received_total{instance=~\"$instance\"}[5m]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "收到"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(ihui_alertbridge_alerts_dedup_suppressed_total{instance=~\"$instance\"}[5m]))",
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "去重抑制"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(ihui_alertbridge_mail_alerts_delivered_total{instance=~\"$instance\"}[5m]))",
          "refId": "C",
          "legendFormat": "投递到人"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(ihui_alertbridge_mail_batches_failed_total{instance=~\"$instance\"}[5m]))",
          "refId": "D",
          "legendFormat": "投递失败"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "id": 7,
      "description": "到人通道的真实计数(自研桥发射):收到→抑制→投递→失败四条线并排,才是\"告警到底有没有到人\"的证据链。"
    },
    {
      "title": "活跃与抑制告警数趋势",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 22
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (state) (alertmanager_alerts{instance=~\"$instance\"})",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{state}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "id": 8
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "30s",
  "schemaVersion": 38,
  "style": "dark",
  "tags": ["ihui-ai", "domain:alert_history", "alertmanager", "alerting"],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "instance",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "Prometheus"
        },
        "query": "label_values(up{job=~\"alertmanager|alertbridge\"}, instance)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {},
  "timezone": "browser",
  "title": "IHUI-AI 告警历史与趋势",
  "uid": "ihui-ai-alert-history",
  "version": 1,
  "weekStart": ""
}
